| Transport refusal | Message class | Ceiling |
|---|---|---|
| Truncated, TrailingBytes, IllFormed, InvalidUtf8 | Malformed | null |
| TransportValue: tag, other simple value, non-finite float or non-text map key | Malformed | null |
| DuplicateMapKey, at any depth | Malformed | null |
| TransportLimit: input bytes, allocation bytes, items, depth, nesting, work | Unsupported | transport, decoded_bytes, decoded_items, input_nesting, cbor_nesting, decoding_work, respectively |
| TransportAllocation | ResourceLimit | null |

